{
    "faq": [
        {
            "a": "Every one of the 2 versions of StepFun Step in the OpenRouter catalog publishes open weights. The family's repositories on Hugging Face declare the Apache 2.0 licence.",
            "q": "Is StepFun Step open source?"
        },
        {
            "a": "Through the OpenRouter catalog, StepFun Step costs from $0.1 to $0.2 per million input tokens and from $0.3 to $1.15 per million output tokens, depending on the version. The cheapest is Step 3.5 Flash.",
            "q": "How much does StepFun Step cost?"
        },
        {
            "a": "Step 3.7 Flash is the newest version in the OpenRouter catalog, added on 2026-05-28.",
            "q": "What is the newest StepFun Step model?"
        },
        {
            "a": "StepFun Step versions accept image, text and video as input and produce text. All 2 versions support reasoning, and every version has a context window of 262,144 tokens.",
            "q": "What can StepFun Step do?"
        },
        {
            "a": "StepFun's own site names these ways to use its models: StepFun API Platform, Stepfun Open Platform, Step Plan, Step platform, Messages API and Realtime API. In the OpenRouter catalog, 3 providers serve it.",
            "q": "Where can I use StepFun Step?"
        }
    ],
