        "paragraphs": [
            "StepFun Step is a family of models from the developer StepFun, offered through the StepFun API Platform. StepFun says step-5-preview is the flagship model for agentic work, step-3.7-flash is a high-speed multimodal reasoning model, step-3.5-flash is a high-speed model for agent and coding tasks, and step-3.5-flash-2603 is a version optimized for high-frequency agent scenarios. The family also includes speech models such as stepaudio-2.5-tts, a next-generation contextual TTS model, and stepaudio-2.5-asr, a next-generation automatic speech recognition model, plus step-router-v1, a smart routing model that dispatches requests by task complexity. StepFun says more StepFun flagship models will be added over time.",
            "StepFun offers these models in two ways. The standard API channel has its own quota and pay-as-you-go pricing. Step Plan is a subscription service from the StepFun API Platform that lets you use StepFun models at a subscription price in coding tools and agent platforms such as OpenClaw, Claude Code, Trae, and Cursor. Step Plan uses Credits as its unified billing unit, with four tiers named Flash Mini, Flash Plus, Flash Pro, and Flash Max, and booster packs available when the monthly allowance runs out. StepFun says every tier provides the same high-speed model performance."
        ],
