        "text": "StepFun Step is a small family, with 2 versions in the OpenRouter catalog, and both publish open weights and support reasoning. Both offer a 262144 token context window, and both accept image, text and video input while returning text. The newest version, Step 3.7 Flash, allows up to 230400 output tokens at $0.2 per million input and $1.15 per million output. The earlier Step 3.5 Flash caps output at 65536 tokens but costs less, $0.1 input and $0.3 output. The facts suggest the family suits long-context work over mixed media, especially tasks needing reasoning and very long answers, and open weights help those who self-host. The limits are the narrow version spread and the higher output price of the newer tier.",
